  "content": "<p>本模组调整了耕地踩踏机制，以保护耕地免受踩踏破坏。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>功能包括：</p><ul>\n<li>附魔“摔落缓冲”可防止耕地被踩踏。</li>\n<li>皮革靴子及其他带有“tramplenomore:soft_boots”物品标签的物品可防止作物被踩踏。</li>\n<li>创造模式玩家无法踩踏作物。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>喜欢这个模组并想支持我？</strong></p><ul>\n<li>在<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>上关注我</li>\n<li>加入我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>上赞助我</li>\n<li>访问我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>本项目由Nodecraft赞助。使用优惠码<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>可享受首月服务30%折扣！<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/trample-no-more\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>徽标由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252florc%252fboot-stomp.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lorc</a>在Game Icons提供，基于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a>协议授权。</p>",
